<figure id="S3.F2.sf3" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center">
<div id="S3.F2.sf3.1" class="ltx_block ltx_minipage ltx_align_top" style="width:110.4pt;"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.01377v1/x4.svg" id="S3.F2.sf3.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:153/121;" width="153" height="121"></object>
</div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(c) </span>Ring Graph</figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Fig. 2: </span>Validation losses in decentralized training of Transformer models over complete, directed exponential, and ring graphs.
</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="S3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Across all network structures, DeMuon demonstrates rapid initial convergence and consistently reduces the validation loss to a low level within approximately 500 rounds. Specifically, we observe that</p>
</div>
<div id="S3.p3" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="S3.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S3.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S3.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">On the directed exponential and ring graphs, DeMuon achieves a validation loss close to that of GT_NSGDm, while significantly outperforming both DSGD and DSGD_Clip, which remain trapped at higher loss values. This highlights the robustness of DeMuon to limited connectivity and directed communication constraints.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S3.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">On the complete graph, DeMuon initially converges rapidly to a low validation loss, but exhibits some instability in later rounds compared to GT_NSGDm. Nevertheless, it still provides a substantial improvement over both DSGD and DSGD_Clip, suggesting that DeMuon maintains competitive performance in dense networks.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="S3.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.p4.1" class="ltx_p">Overall, these results confirm that DeMuon offers a strong balance between fast convergence and robustness across network topologies in the decentralized training of large-scale Transformer models, making it a promising approach for collaborative language modeling tasks.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S4" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">IV </span><span id="S4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Proof of the Main Results</span></h2>

<div id="S4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we provide the proofs of our main results presented in Section <a href="#S2" title="II A Decentralized Muon ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">II</span></a>, particularly, Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma1" title="Lemma 1 (consensus error). ‣ II A Decentralized Muon ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> and Theorem <a href="#Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem 1 (iteration complexity). ‣ II A Decentralized Muon ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<div id="S4.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.p2.1" class="ltx_p">For notational convenience, we define a sequence of potentials:</p>
<table id="S4.EGx14" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S4.E9"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.E9.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{P}_{k}:=f(\overline{X}^{k})+p\|\nabla F(X^{k}_{[N]})-M^{k}_{[N]}\|_{F}^{\alpha}+q\|V^{k}_{[N]}-\mathbf{1}_{N}\otimes" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒫</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">:=</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">f</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">p</mi><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup><msubsup><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0em">∥</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">q</mi><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msub><mn mathsize="0.900em">𝟏</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em">⊗</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{P}_{k}:=f(\overline{X}^{k})+p\|\nabla F(X^{k}_{[N]})-M^{k}_{[N]}\|_{F}^{\alpha}+q\|V^{k}_{[N]}-\mathbf{1}_{N}\otimes</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.E9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\overline{V}^{k}\|_{*}\hskip 9.24994pt\forall k\geq 0," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msup><mo fence="false">|</mo><mrow><mrow><mmultiscripts><mo mathsize="0.900em">∀</mo><mprescripts></mprescripts><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo><mrow></mrow></mmultiscripts><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">≥</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">0</mn></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\overline{V}^{k}\|_{*}\hskip 9.24994pt\forall k\geq 0,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(9)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S4.p2.2" class="ltx_p">where the sequence <math id="S4.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{(X_{i}^{k},M_{i}^{k},V_{i}^{k})\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>M</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{(X_{i}^{k},M_{i}^{k},V_{i}^{k})\}</annotation></semantics></math> is generated by DeMuon, and <math id="S4.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p,q&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p,q&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> are scalars to be specified later. Also, we define <math id="S4.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\xi_{[N]}:=\{\xi_{i}\}_{i=1}^{N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ξ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></msub><mo>:=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>ξ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\xi_{[N]}:=\{\xi_{i}\}_{i=1}^{N}</annotation></semantics></math>, and the stacked notation:</p>
<table id="S4.EGx15" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S4.Ex9"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle G(X_{[N]};\xi_{[N]}):=[G_{1}(X_{1};\xi_{1})^{T},\cdots,G_{N}(X_{N};\xi_{N})^{T}]^{T},\hskip 9.24994ptV_{O,[N]}:=[\mathrm{msgn}(V_{1})^{T},\cdots,\mathrm{msgn}(V_{N})^{T}]^{T}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">G</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">ξ</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">:=</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">G</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">ξ</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">T</mi></msup></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">G</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">ξ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">T</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">T</mi></msup></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="1.097em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">O</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">:=</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">msgn</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">T</mi></msup></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">msgn</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">T</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">T</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle G(X_{[N]};\xi_{[N]}):=[G_{1}(X_{1};\xi_{1})^{T},\cdots,G_{N}(X_{N};\xi_{N})^{T}]^{T},\hskip 9.24994ptV_{O,[N]}:=[\mathrm{msgn}(V_{1})^{T},\cdots,\mathrm{msgn}(V_{N})^{T}]^{T},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S4.p2.3" class="ltx_p">and the average notation <math id="S4.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\overline{V}_{O}:=\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\mathrm{msgn}(V_{i})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>O</mi></msub><mo>:=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup><mrow><mi>msgn</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\overline{V}_{O}:=\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\mathrm{msgn}(V_{i})</annotation></semantics></math>. Using the stacked notation defined above, the updates of DeMuon in (<a href="#S2.E5" title="In 4 ‣ Algorithm 1 ‣ II A Decentralized Muon ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>)-(<a href="#S2.E7" title="In 6 ‣ Algorithm 1 ‣ II A Decentralized Muon ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>) can be rewritten in the following compact form:</p>
<table id="S4.EGx16" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S4.E10"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.E10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle M_{[N]}^{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle M_{[N]}^{k}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.E10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=(1-\theta)M_{[N]}^{k-1}+\theta G(X_{[N]}^{k};\xi_{[N]}^{k})," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">G</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">ξ</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=(1-\theta)M_{[N]}^{k-1}+\theta G(X_{[N]}^{k};\xi_{[N]}^{k}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(10)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S4.E11"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.E11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle V_{[N]}^{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle V_{[N]}^{k}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.E11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=(W\otimes I_{m})(V_{[N]}^{k-1}+M_{[N]}^{k}-M_{[N]}^{k-1})," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">W</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">I</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=(W\otimes I_{m})(V_{[N]}^{k-1}+M_{[N]}^{k}-M_{[N]}^{k-1}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(11)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S4.E12"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.E12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle X_{[N]}^{k+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle X_{[N]}^{k+1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.E12.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=(W\otimes I_{m})(X_{[N]}^{k}-\eta V^{k}_{O,[N]})\hskip 9.24994pt\forall k=0,1,\ldots." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">W</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">I</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">O</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="1.097em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">0</mn></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em" mathvariant="normal">…</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=(W\otimes I_{m})(X_{[N]}^{k}-\eta V^{k}_{O,[N]})\hskip 9.24994pt\forall k=0,1,\ldots.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(12)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S4.p2.4" class="ltx_p">Moreover, using the doubly stochasticity of <math id="S4.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>W</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W</annotation></semantics></math> imposed in Assumption <a href="#Thmassumption1" title="Assumption 1. ‣ I-B Assumptions ‣ I Introduction ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>(d), we obtain from (<a href="#S4.E12" title="In IV Proof of the Main Results ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>) the updates of <math id="S4.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{\overline{X}^{k}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\overline{X}^{k}\}</annotation></semantics></math> as</p>
<table id="S4.EGx17" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S4.E13"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.E13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\overline{X}^{k+1}=\overline{X}^{k}-\eta\overline{V}^{k}_{O}\hskip 9.24994pt\forall k=0,1,2,\ldots." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">O</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">0</mn></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em" mathvariant="normal">…</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\overline{X}^{k+1}=\overline{X}^{k}-\eta\overline{V}^{k}_{O}\hskip 9.24994pt\forall k=0,1,2,\ldots.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(13)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="S4.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.p3.1" class="ltx_p">We next provide a technical lemma regarding the expansion of <math id="S4.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|U+V\|^{\alpha}_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>α</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|U+V\|^{\alpha}_{F}</annotation></semantics></math>, whose proof can be found in <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib38" title="" class="ltx_ref">38</a>, Lemma 1]</cite>.</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmlemma2" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlemma2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 2</span></span><span id="Thmlemma2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlemma2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmlemma2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">For any <math id="Thmlemma2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha\in(1,2]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha\in(1,2]</annotation></semantics></math>, we have</span></p>
<table id="S4.EGx18" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S4.Ex10"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\|U+V\|_{F}^{\alpha}\leq\|U\|_{F}^{\alpha}+\alpha\|U\|_{F}^{\alpha-2}\langle U,V\rangle+2\|V\|_{F}^{\alpha}\hskip 9.24994pt\forall U,V\in\mathbb{R}^{m\times n}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">U</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">≤</mo><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">U</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">U</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟨</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">U</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⟩</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">U</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">∈</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">ℝ</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\|U+V\|_{F}^{\alpha}\leq\|U\|_{F}^{\alpha}+\alpha\|U\|_{F}^{\alpha-2}\langle U,V\rangle+2\|V\|_{F}^{\alpha}\hskip 9.24994pt\forall U,V\in\mathbb{R}^{m\times n},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S4.Ex11"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\|U+V\|_{F}^{\alpha}\leq(1+c)\|U\|_{F}^{\alpha}+(2+(\alpha-1)^{\alpha-1}c^{1-\alpha})\|V\|_{F}^{\alpha}\hskip 9.24994pt\forall U,V\in\mathbb{R}^{m\times n},c&gt;0." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">U</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">c</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">U</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">c</mi><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">U</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">∈</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">ℝ</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">c</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">&gt;</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">0</mn></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\|U+V\|_{F}^{\alpha}\leq(1+c)\|U\|_{F}^{\alpha}+(2+(\alpha-1)^{\alpha-1}c^{1-\alpha})\|V\|_{F}^{\alpha}\hskip 9.24994pt\forall U,V\in\mathbb{R}^{m\times n},c&gt;0.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S4.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.p4.1" class="ltx_p">We also establish the following technical lemma for the analysis of decentralized algorithms involving spectral and nuclear norms.</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmlemma3" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlemma3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 3</span></span><span id="Thmlemma3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlemma3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmlemma3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Suppose that Assumption <a href="#Thmassumption1" title="Assumption 1. ‣ I-B Assumptions ‣ I Introduction ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> holds. Let <math id="Thmlemma3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{Y_{i}\}_{i=1}^{N}\subset\mathbb{R}^{m\times n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup><mo>⊂</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{Y_{i}\}_{i=1}^{N}\subset\mathbb{R}^{m\times n}</annotation></semantics></math> be arbitrarily given, and let <math id="Thmlemma3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W\in\mathbb{R}^{N\times N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W\in\mathbb{R}^{N\times N}</annotation></semantics></math> be the mixing matrix. Then, the following statements hold.</span></p>
<ol id="S4.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="S4.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(i)</span> 
<div id="S4.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="S4.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\|Y_{i}\|\leq\|Y_{[N]}\|\leq(\sum_{i=1}^{N}\|Y_{i}\|^{2})^{1/2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\|Y_{i}\|\leq\|Y_{[N]}\|\leq(\sum_{i=1}^{N}\|Y_{i}\|^{2})^{1/2}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S4.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> and </span><math id="S4.I1.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\|Y_{i}\|_{*}\leq\|Y_{[N]}\|_{*}\leq\sum_{i=1}^{N}\|Y_{i}\|_{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msub><mo rspace="0.111em">≤</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}\|Y_{i}\|_{*}\leq\|Y_{[N]}\|_{*}\leq\sum_{i=1}^{N}\|Y_{i}\|_{*}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S4.I1.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">;</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="S4.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(ii)</span> 
<div id="S4.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="S4.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{1}{N}(\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T}\otimes I_{m})X_{[N]}=\mathbf{1}_{N}\otimes\overline{X}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mn>𝟏</mn><mi>N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mn>𝟏</mn><mi>N</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mn>𝟏</mn><mi>N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{1}{N}(\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T}\otimes I_{m})X_{[N]}=\mathbf{1}_{N}\otimes\overline{X}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S4.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">;</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="S4.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">(iii)</span> 
<div id="S4.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="S4.I1.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(W-\frac{1}{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T})(I_{N}-\frac{1}{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T})=W-\frac{1}{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T}=(I_{N}-\frac{1}{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T})(W-\frac{1}{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mn>𝟏</mn><mi>N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mn>𝟏</mn><mi>N</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mn>𝟏</mn><mi>N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mn>𝟏</mn><mi>N</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mn>𝟏</mn><mi>N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mn>𝟏</mn><mi>N</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mn>𝟏</mn><mi>N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mn>𝟏</mn><mi>N</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mn>𝟏</mn><mi>N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mn>𝟏</mn><mi>N</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(W-\frac{1}{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T})(I_{N}-\frac{1}{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T})=W-\frac{1}{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T}=(I_{N}-\frac{1}{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T})(W-\frac{1}{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T})</annotation></semantics></math><span id="S4.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">.</span></p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S4.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="S4.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text">To prove statement (i), it suffices to show</span></p>
<table id="S4.EGx19" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S4.Ex12"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\|A_{1}\|\leq\|[A_{1}^{T},A_{2}^{T}]^{T}\|\leq(\|A_{1}\|^{2}+\|A_{2}\|^{2})^{1/2},\hskip 9.24994pt\|A_{1}\|_{*}\leq\|[A_{1}^{T},A_{2}^{T}]^{T}\|_{*}\leq\|A_{1}\|_{*}+\|A_{2}\|_{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">≤</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">T</mi></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">T</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">T</mi></msup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">≤</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msup></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="1.097em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">≤</mo><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">T</mi></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">T</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">T</mi></msup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">≤</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\|A_{1}\|\leq\|[A_{1}^{T},A_{2}^{T}]^{T}\|\leq(\|A_{1}\|^{2}+\|A_{2}\|^{2})^{1/2},\hskip 9.24994pt\|A_{1}\|_{*}\leq\|[A_{1}^{T},A_{2}^{T}]^{T}\|_{*}\leq\|A_{1}\|_{*}+\|A_{2}\|_{*}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S4.p5.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.p5.2.1" class="ltx_text">hold for all <math id="S4.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A_{1}\in\mathbb{R}^{m_{1}\times n},A_{2}\in\mathbb{R}^{m_{2}\times n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A_{1}\in\mathbb{R}^{m_{1}\times n},A_{2}\in\mathbb{R}^{m_{2}\times n}</annotation></semantics></math>. To this end, we let <math id="S4.p5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P:=[I_{m_{1}\times m_{1}},\mathbf{0}_{m_{1}\times m_{2}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>:=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mn>𝟎</mn><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P:=[I_{m_{1}\times m_{1}},\mathbf{0}_{m_{1}\times m_{2}}]</annotation></semantics></math>. One has</span></p>
<table id="S4.EGx20" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S4.E14"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.E14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\|A_{1}\|=\left\|P\left[\begin{smallmatrix}A_{1}\\
A_{2}\end{smallmatrix}\right]\right\|\leq\|P\|\cdot\left\|\left[\begin{smallmatrix}A_{1}\\
A_{2}\end{smallmatrix}\right]\right\|=\left\|\left[\begin{smallmatrix}A_{1}\\
A_{2}\end{smallmatrix}\right]\right\|," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">P</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mtable rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.700em">1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.700em">2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">P</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" rspace="0.055em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mtable rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.700em">1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.700em">2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mtable rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.700em">1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.700em">2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\|A_{1}\|=\left\|P\left[\begin{smallmatrix}A_{1}\\
A_{2}\end{smallmatrix}\right]\right\|\leq\|P\|\cdot\left\|\left[\begin{smallmatrix}A_{1}\\
A_{2}\end{smallmatrix}\right]\right\|=\left\|\left[\begin{smallmatrix}A_{1}\\
A_{2}\end{smallmatrix}\right]\right\|,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(14)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S4.E15"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.E15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\|A_{1}\|_{*}=\left\|P\left[\begin{smallmatrix}A_{1}\\
A_{2}\end{smallmatrix}\right]\right\|_{*}\leq\|P\|\cdot\left\|\left[\begin{smallmatrix}A_{1}\\
A_{2}\end{smallmatrix}\right]\right\|_{*}=\left\|\left[\begin{smallmatrix}A_{1}\\
A_{2}\end{smallmatrix}\right]\right\|_{*}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">P</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mtable rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.700em">1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.700em">2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">P</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" rspace="0.055em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mtable rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.700em">1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.700em">2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mtable rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.700em">1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.700em">2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\|A_{1}\|_{*}=\left\|P\left[\begin{smallmatrix}A_{1}\\
A_{2}\end{smallmatrix}\right]\right\|_{*}\leq\|P\|\cdot\left\|\left[\begin{smallmatrix}A_{1}\\
A_{2}\end{smallmatrix}\right]\right\|_{*}=\left\|\left[\begin{smallmatrix}A_{1}\\
A_{2}\end{smallmatrix}\right]\right\|_{*}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(15)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S4.p5.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.p5.3.1" class="ltx_text">where the inequalities are due to the (mixed) submultiplicativity of the spectral norm and the nuclear norm, respectively. In addition, notice that</span></p>
<table id="S4.EGx21" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S4.Ex13"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\|\left[\begin{smallmatrix}A_{1}\\
A_{2}\end{smallmatrix}\right]\right\|^{2}\leq\|A_{1}^{T}A_{1}\|+\|A_{2}^{T}A_{2}\|=\|A_{1}\|^{2}+\|A_{2}\|^{2},\hskip 9.24994pt\left\|\left[\begin{smallmatrix}A_{1}\\
A_{2}\end{smallmatrix}\right]\right\|_{*}\leq\left\|\left[\begin{smallmatrix}A_{1}\\
\mathbf{0}_{m_{2}\times n}\end{smallmatrix}\right]\right\|_{*}+\left\|\left[\begin{smallmatrix}\mathbf{0}_{m_{1}\times n}\\
A_{2}\end{smallmatrix}\right]\right\|_{*}=\|A_{1}\|_{*}+\|A_{2}\|_{*}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mtable rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.700em">1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.700em">2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">T</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">T</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="1.097em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mtable rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.700em">1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.700em">2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">≤</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mtable rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.700em">1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mn mathsize="0.700em">𝟎</mn><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">m</mi><mn mathsize="0.700em">2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.700em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi mathsize="0.700em">n</mi></mrow></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mtable rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd><msub><mn mathsize="0.700em">𝟎</mn><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">m</mi><mn mathsize="0.700em">1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.700em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi mathsize="0.700em">n</mi></mrow></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathsize="0.700em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.700em">2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>]</mo></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">A</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\|\left[\begin{smallmatrix}A_{1}\\
A_{2}\end{smallmatrix}\right]\right\|^{2}\leq\|A_{1}^{T}A_{1}\|+\|A_{2}^{T}A_{2}\|=\|A_{1}\|^{2}+\|A_{2}\|^{2},\hskip 9.24994pt\left\|\left[\begin{smallmatrix}A_{1}\\
A_{2}\end{smallmatrix}\right]\right\|_{*}\leq\left\|\left[\begin{smallmatrix}A_{1}\\
\mathbf{0}_{m_{2}\times n}\end{smallmatrix}\right]\right\|_{*}+\left\|\left[\begin{smallmatrix}\mathbf{0}_{m_{1}\times n}\\
A_{2}\end{smallmatrix}\right]\right\|_{*}=\|A_{1}\|_{*}+\|A_{2}\|_{*},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S4.p5.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.p5.4.1" class="ltx_text">which along with (<a href="#S4.E14" title="In Proof. ‣ IV Proof of the Main Results ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">14</span></a>) and (<a href="#S4.E15" title="In Proof. ‣ IV Proof of the Main Results ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a>) implies that statement (i) holds.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="S4.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text">Statement (ii) holds because</span></p>
<table id="S4.EGx22" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S4.Ex14"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\frac{(\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T}\otimes I_{m})X_{[N]}}{N}=\frac{1}{N}\begin{bmatrix}I_{m}&amp;\cdots&amp;I_{m}\\
\vdots&amp;\ddots&amp;\vdots\\
I_{m}&amp;\cdots&amp;I_{m}\end{bmatrix}\cdot\begin{bmatrix}X_{1}\\
\vdots\\
X_{N}\end{bmatrix}=\mathbf{1}_{N}\otimes\overline{X}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mn mathsize="0.900em">𝟏</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mn mathsize="0.900em">𝟏</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">T</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">I</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">I</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi></msub></mtd><mtd><mo mathsize="0.900em">⋯</mo></mtd><mtd><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">I</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi mathsize="0.900em" mathvariant="normal">⋱</mi></mtd><mtd></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">I</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi></msub></mtd><mtd><mo mathsize="0.900em">⋯</mo></mtd><mtd><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">I</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo rspace="0.055em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mtable rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><msub><mn mathsize="0.900em">𝟏</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\frac{(\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T}\otimes I_{m})X_{[N]}}{N}=\frac{1}{N}\begin{bmatrix}I_{m}&amp;\cdots&amp;I_{m}\\
\vdots&amp;\ddots&amp;\vdots\\
I_{m}&amp;\cdots&amp;I_{m}\end{bmatrix}\cdot\begin{bmatrix}X_{1}\\
\vdots\\
X_{N}\end{bmatrix}=\mathbf{1}_{N}\otimes\overline{X}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S4.p6.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.p6.2.1" class="ltx_text">In addition, statement (iii) holds true because <math id="S4.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T}=\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T}=\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T}W" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mn>𝟏</mn><mi>N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mn>𝟏</mn><mi>N</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mn>𝟏</mn><mi>N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mn>𝟏</mn><mi>N</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mn>𝟏</mn><mi>N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mn>𝟏</mn><mi>N</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T}=\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T}=\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T}W</annotation></semantics></math> due to the double stochasticity of <math id="S4.p6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>W</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W</annotation></semantics></math>.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S4.p7" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.p7.1" class="ltx_p">We next prove Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma1" title="Lemma 1 (consensus error). ‣ II A Decentralized Muon ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<div id="S4.3" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_bold ltx_title_proof">Proof of Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma1" title="Lemma 1 (consensus error). ‣ II A Decentralized Muon ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>.</h6>
<div id="S4.p8" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.p8.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.p8.1.1" class="ltx_text">When <math id="S4.p8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=0</annotation></semantics></math>, this lemma holds due to <math id="S4.p8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="X^{0}_{i}=\overline{X}^{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">X^{0}_{i}=\overline{X}^{0}</annotation></semantics></math> for all <math id="S4.p8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\leq i\leq N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\leq i\leq N</annotation></semantics></math>. We next prove this lemma for any <math id="S4.p8.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k\geq 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k\geq 1</annotation></semantics></math>. Fix any <math id="S4.p8.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k\geq 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k\geq 1</annotation></semantics></math>. It follows from (<a href="#S4.E12" title="In IV Proof of the Main Results ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>), and Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma3" title="Lemma 3. ‣ IV Proof of the Main Results ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>(ii) and (iii) that</span></p>
<table id="S4.EGx23" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S4.Ex15"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle X^{k}_{[N]}-\mathbf{1}_{N}\otimes\overline{X}^{k}=\Big(\Big(I_{N}-\frac{1}{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T}\Big)\otimes I_{m}\Big)X^{k}_{[N]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><msub><mn mathsize="0.900em">𝟏</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">I</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mn mathsize="0.900em">𝟏</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mn mathsize="0.900em">𝟏</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">T</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" rspace="0.055em">)</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">I</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle X^{k}_{[N]}-\mathbf{1}_{N}\otimes\overline{X}^{k}=\Big(\Big(I_{N}-\frac{1}{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T}\Big)\otimes I_{m}\Big)X^{k}_{[N]}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S4.Ex16"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\overset{\eqref{def:ave-2}}{=}\Big(\Big(I_{N}-\frac{1}{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T}\Big)\otimes I_{m}\Big)(W\otimes I_{m})\big(X_{[N]}^{k-1}-\eta V^{k-1}_{O,[N]}\big)=\Big(\Big(W-\frac{1}{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T}\Big)\otimes I_{m}\Big)\big(X_{[N]}^{k-1}-\eta V^{k-1}_{O,[N]}\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mtext mathsize="0.630em">(</mtext><mtext mathsize="0.630em"><a href="#S4.E12" title="In IV Proof of the Main Results ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref" style="font-size:63%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a></mtext><mtext mathsize="0.630em">)</mtext></mrow></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">I</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mn mathsize="0.900em">𝟏</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mn mathsize="0.900em">𝟏</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">T</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" rspace="0.055em">)</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">I</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">W</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">I</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">O</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">W</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mn mathsize="0.900em">𝟏</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mn mathsize="0.900em">𝟏</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">T</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" rspace="0.055em">)</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">I</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">O</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\overset{\eqref{def:ave-2}}{=}\Big(\Big(I_{N}-\frac{1}{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T}\Big)\otimes I_{m}\Big)(W\otimes I_{m})\big(X_{[N]}^{k-1}-\eta V^{k-1}_{O,[N]}\big)=\Big(\Big(W-\frac{1}{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T}\Big)\otimes I_{m}\Big)\big(X_{[N]}^{k-1}-\eta V^{k-1}_{O,[N]}\big)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
