<tbody id="S4.Ex31"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex31.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq f(\overline{X}^{k})-\eta\|\overline{\nabla}F({X}_{[N]}^{k})\|_{*}+2\eta\|\nabla F(X_{[N]}^{k})-M^{k}_{[N]}\|_{*}+2\eta\|V^{k}_{[N]}-\mathbf{1}_{N}\otimes\overline{V}^{k}\|_{*}+\Big(\frac{\sqrt{N}\lambda}{1-\lambda}+\frac{1}{2}\Big)L_{*}\eta^{2}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo mathsize="0.900em">≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mo mathsize="0.900em">∇</mo><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><msub><mn mathsize="0.900em">𝟏</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">L</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">η</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq f(\overline{X}^{k})-\eta\|\overline{\nabla}F({X}_{[N]}^{k})\|_{*}+2\eta\|\nabla F(X_{[N]}^{k})-M^{k}_{[N]}\|_{*}+2\eta\|V^{k}_{[N]}-\mathbf{1}_{N}\otimes\overline{V}^{k}\|_{*}+\Big(\frac{\sqrt{N}\lambda}{1-\lambda}+\frac{1}{2}\Big)L_{*}\eta^{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S4.p10.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.p10.5.1" class="ltx_text">Hence, this lemma holds as desired.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S4.p11" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.p11.1" class="ltx_p">The following lemma provides a recurrence relation for the consensus error of <math id="S4.p11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{V_{i}^{k}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{V_{i}^{k}\}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmlemma5" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlemma5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 5</span></span><span id="Thmlemma5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlemma5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmlemma5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Suppose that Assumption <a href="#Thmassumption1" title="Assumption 1. ‣ I-B Assumptions ‣ I Introduction ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> holds. Let <math id="Thmlemma5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{(X^{k}_{i},M_{i}^{k},V^{k}_{i})\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>M</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{(X^{k}_{i},M_{i}^{k},V^{k}_{i})\}</annotation></semantics></math> be generated by Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ II A Decentralized Muon ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> with input parameters <math id="Thmlemma5.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>η</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Thmlemma5.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>θ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta</annotation></semantics></math>. Then it holds that for all <math id="Thmlemma5.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k\geq-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k\geq-1</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="S4.EGx30" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S4.E19"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.E19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}_{\xi_{[N]}^{k+1}}[\|V_{[N]}^{k+1}-\mathbf{1}_{N}\otimes\overline{V}^{k+1}\|_{*}]\leq\lambda\|V^{k}_{[N]}-\mathbf{1}_{N}\otimes\overline{V}^{k}\|_{*}+\frac{\lambda\theta}{1-\theta}\Big(\mathbb{E}_{\xi_{[N]}^{k+1}}[\|\nabla F(X_{[N]}^{k+1})-M^{k+1}_{[N]}\|_{*}]+\sigma\Big)," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝔼</mi><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">ξ</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><msub><mn mathsize="0.900em">𝟏</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><msub><mn mathsize="0.900em">𝟏</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝔼</mi><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">ξ</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">σ</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}_{\xi_{[N]}^{k+1}}[\|V_{[N]}^{k+1}-\mathbf{1}_{N}\otimes\overline{V}^{k+1}\|_{*}]\leq\lambda\|V^{k}_{[N]}-\mathbf{1}_{N}\otimes\overline{V}^{k}\|_{*}+\frac{\lambda\theta}{1-\theta}\Big(\mathbb{E}_{\xi_{[N]}^{k+1}}[\|\nabla F(X_{[N]}^{k+1})-M^{k+1}_{[N]}\|_{*}]+\sigma\Big),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(19)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmlemma5.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma5.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">where <math id="Thmlemma5.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>λ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda</annotation></semantics></math> is given in (<a href="#S1.E4" title="In Remark 1. ‣ I-B Assumptions ‣ I Introduction ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>), and <math id="Thmlemma5.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>σ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma</annotation></semantics></math> is given in Assumption <a href="#Thmassumption1" title="Assumption 1. ‣ I-B Assumptions ‣ I Introduction ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>(c).</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S4.5" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="S4.p12" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.p12.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.p12.1.1" class="ltx_text">Fix any <math id="S4.p12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k\geq-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k\geq-1</annotation></semantics></math>. It follows that</span></p>
<table id="S4.EGx31" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S4.Ex32"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex32.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle V^{k+1}_{[N]}-\mathbf{1}_{N}\otimes\overline{V}^{k+1}=\Big(\Big(I_{N}-\frac{1}{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T}\Big)\otimes I_{m}\Big)V_{[N]}^{k+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><msub><mn mathsize="0.900em">𝟏</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">I</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mn mathsize="0.900em">𝟏</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mn mathsize="0.900em">𝟏</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">T</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" rspace="0.055em">)</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">I</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle V^{k+1}_{[N]}-\mathbf{1}_{N}\otimes\overline{V}^{k+1}=\Big(\Big(I_{N}-\frac{1}{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T}\Big)\otimes I_{m}\Big)V_{[N]}^{k+1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S4.Ex33"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex33.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\overset{\eqref{def:ave-1}}{=}\Big(\Big(W-\frac{1}{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T}\Big)\otimes I_{m}\Big)(V^{k}_{[N]}+M^{k+1}_{[N]}-M^{k}_{[N]})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mtext mathsize="0.630em">(</mtext><mtext mathsize="0.630em"><a href="#S4.E11" title="In IV Proof of the Main Results ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref" style="font-size:63%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a></mtext><mtext mathsize="0.630em">)</mtext></mrow></mover><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">W</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mn mathsize="0.900em">𝟏</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mn mathsize="0.900em">𝟏</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">T</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" rspace="0.055em">)</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">I</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\overset{\eqref{def:ave-1}}{=}\Big(\Big(W-\frac{1}{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T}\Big)\otimes I_{m}\Big)(V^{k}_{[N]}+M^{k+1}_{[N]}-M^{k}_{[N]})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S4.E20"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.E20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\Big(\Big(W-\frac{1}{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T}\Big)\otimes I_{m}\Big)\big(V_{[N]}^{k}-\mathbf{1}_{N}\otimes\overline{V}^{k}+M^{k+1}_{[N]}-M^{k}_{[N]}\big)," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">W</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mn mathsize="0.900em">𝟏</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mn mathsize="0.900em">𝟏</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">T</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em" rspace="0.055em">)</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">I</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><msub><mn mathsize="0.900em">𝟏</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\Big(\Big(W-\frac{1}{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}\mathbf{1}_{N}^{T}\Big)\otimes I_{m}\Big)\big(V_{[N]}^{k}-\mathbf{1}_{N}\otimes\overline{V}^{k}+M^{k+1}_{[N]}-M^{k}_{[N]}\big),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(20)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S4.p12.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.p12.2.1" class="ltx_text">where the first equality is due to Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma3" title="Lemma 3. ‣ IV Proof of the Main Results ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>(ii), the second equality follows from (<a href="#S1.E2" title="In I-A Notation ‣ I Introduction ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>) and (<a href="#S4.E11" title="In IV Proof of the Main Results ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a>), and the last equality is due to (<a href="#S1.E2" title="In I-A Notation ‣ I Introduction ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>) and Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma3" title="Lemma 3. ‣ IV Proof of the Main Results ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>(iii). We also recall from (<a href="#S4.E10" title="In IV Proof of the Main Results ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>) that</span></p>
<table id="S4.EGx32" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S4.Ex34"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex34.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle M^{k+1}_{[N]}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle M^{k+1}_{[N]}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex34.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle-M^{k}_{[N]}=\theta(G(X_{[N]}^{k+1};\xi^{k+1}_{[N]})-\nabla F(X_{[N]}^{k+1}))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">G</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">ξ</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle-M^{k}_{[N]}=\theta(G(X_{[N]}^{k+1};\xi^{k+1}_{[N]})-\nabla F(X_{[N]}^{k+1}))</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S4.Ex35"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex35.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle+\theta(M^{k+1}_{[N]}-M^{k}_{[N]})+\theta(\nabla F(X_{[N]}^{k+1})-M^{k+1}_{[N]})," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle+\theta(M^{k+1}_{[N]}-M^{k}_{[N]})+\theta(\nabla F(X_{[N]}^{k+1})-M^{k+1}_{[N]}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S4.p12.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.p12.3.1" class="ltx_text">which implies that</span></p>
<table id="S4.EGx33" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S4.Ex36"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex36.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle M^{k+1}_{[N]}-M^{k}_{[N]}=\frac{\theta}{1-\theta}(G(X_{[N]}^{k+1};\xi^{k+1}_{[N]})-\nabla F(X_{[N]}^{k+1}))+\frac{\theta}{1-\theta}(\nabla F(X_{[N]}^{k+1})-M^{k+1}_{[N]})." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">G</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">ξ</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle M^{k+1}_{[N]}-M^{k}_{[N]}=\frac{\theta}{1-\theta}(G(X_{[N]}^{k+1};\xi^{k+1}_{[N]})-\nabla F(X_{[N]}^{k+1}))+\frac{\theta}{1-\theta}(\nabla F(X_{[N]}^{k+1})-M^{k+1}_{[N]}).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S4.p12.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.p12.4.1" class="ltx_text">By this, (<a href="#S1.E4" title="In Remark 1. ‣ I-B Assumptions ‣ I Introduction ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>), (<a href="#S4.E20" title="In Proof. ‣ IV Proof of the Main Results ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">20</span></a>), Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma3" title="Lemma 3. ‣ IV Proof of the Main Results ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>(i), and Assumption <a href="#Thmassumption1" title="Assumption 1. ‣ I-B Assumptions ‣ I Introduction ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>(c), we see that</span></p>
<table id="S4.EGx34" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S4.Ex37"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex37.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}_{\xi_{[N]}^{k+1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝔼</mi><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">ξ</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}_{\xi_{[N]}^{k+1}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex37.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle[\|V_{[N]}^{k+1}-\mathbf{1}_{N}\otimes\overline{V}^{k+1}\|_{*}]\leq\lambda\|V_{[N]}^{k}-\mathbf{1}_{N}\otimes\overline{V}^{k}\|_{*}+\frac{N\sigma\lambda\theta}{1-\theta}+\frac{\lambda\theta}{1-\theta}\mathbb{E}_{\xi_{[N]}^{k+1}}[\|\nabla F(X_{[N]}^{k+1})-M^{k+1}_{[N]}\|_{*}]," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><msub><mn mathsize="0.900em">𝟏</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><msub><mn mathsize="0.900em">𝟏</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">σ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝔼</mi><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">ξ</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle[\|V_{[N]}^{k+1}-\mathbf{1}_{N}\otimes\overline{V}^{k+1}\|_{*}]\leq\lambda\|V_{[N]}^{k}-\mathbf{1}_{N}\otimes\overline{V}^{k}\|_{*}+\frac{N\sigma\lambda\theta}{1-\theta}+\frac{\lambda\theta}{1-\theta}\mathbb{E}_{\xi_{[N]}^{k+1}}[\|\nabla F(X_{[N]}^{k+1})-M^{k+1}_{[N]}\|_{*}],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S4.p12.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.p12.5.1" class="ltx_text">Hence, this lemma holds as desired.
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S4.p13" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.p13.1" class="ltx_p">The following lemma provides two recurrence relations for the estimation errors of the stacked momentum sequence <math id="S4.p13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{M_{[N]}^{k}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>M</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{M_{[N]}^{k}\}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmlemma6" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_lemma">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmlemma6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Lemma 6</span></span><span id="Thmlemma6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">.</span></h6>
<div id="Thmlemma6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmlemma6.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Suppose that Assumption <a href="#Thmassumption1" title="Assumption 1. ‣ I-B Assumptions ‣ I Introduction ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> holds. Let <math id="Thmlemma6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{(X_{i}^{k},M_{i}^{k})\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>M</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{(X_{i}^{k},M_{i}^{k})\}</annotation></semantics></math> be generated by Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ II A Decentralized Muon ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> with input parameters <math id="Thmlemma6.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>η</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Thmlemma6.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>θ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta</annotation></semantics></math>. Then it holds that for all <math id="Thmlemma6.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="S4.EGx35" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S4.E21"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.E21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}_{\xi^{k+1}_{[N]}}[\|\nabla F({X}^{k+1}_{[N]})-M_{[N]}^{k+1}\|_{*}]\leq(1-\theta)\|\nabla F({X}^{k}_{[N]})-M_{[N]}^{k}\|_{*}+(1-\theta)L_{F}\Big(\frac{2\sqrt{N}\lambda}{1-\lambda}+1\Big)\eta+N\sigma\theta," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝔼</mi><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">ξ</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">L</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">η</mi></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">σ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}_{\xi^{k+1}_{[N]}}[\|\nabla F({X}^{k+1}_{[N]})-M_{[N]}^{k+1}\|_{*}]\leq(1-\theta)\|\nabla F({X}^{k}_{[N]})-M_{[N]}^{k}\|_{*}+(1-\theta)L_{F}\Big(\frac{2\sqrt{N}\lambda}{1-\lambda}+1\Big)\eta+N\sigma\theta,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(21)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S4.E22"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.E22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}_{\xi^{k+1}_{[N]}}[\|\nabla F({X}^{k+1}_{[N]})-M_{[N]}^{k+1}\|_{F}^{\alpha}]\leq(1-\theta)\|\nabla F({X}^{k}_{[N]})-M_{[N]}^{k}\|_{F}^{\alpha}+3L_{F}^{\alpha}\Big(\frac{2\sqrt{N}\lambda}{1-\lambda}+1\Big)^{\alpha}\theta^{1-\alpha}\eta^{\alpha}+2(N\sigma\theta)^{\alpha}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝔼</mi><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">ξ</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi></msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">L</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">η</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi></msup></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">σ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}_{\xi^{k+1}_{[N]}}[\|\nabla F({X}^{k+1}_{[N]})-M_{[N]}^{k+1}\|_{F}^{\alpha}]\leq(1-\theta)\|\nabla F({X}^{k}_{[N]})-M_{[N]}^{k}\|_{F}^{\alpha}+3L_{F}^{\alpha}\Big(\frac{2\sqrt{N}\lambda}{1-\lambda}+1\Big)^{\alpha}\theta^{1-\alpha}\eta^{\alpha}+2(N\sigma\theta)^{\alpha},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(22)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmlemma6.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmlemma6.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">where <math id="Thmlemma6.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="L_{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>L</mi><mo>∗</mo></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">L_{*}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="Thmlemma6.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>σ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="Thmlemma6.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math> are given in Assumption <a href="#Thmassumption1" title="Assumption 1. ‣ I-B Assumptions ‣ I Introduction ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>, and <math id="Thmlemma6.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>λ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda</annotation></semantics></math> is defined in (<a href="#S1.E4" title="In Remark 1. ‣ I-B Assumptions ‣ I Introduction ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>).</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S4.6" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="S4.p14" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.p14.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.p14.1.1" class="ltx_text">Fix any <math id="S4.p14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math>. It follows from (<a href="#S4.E10" title="In IV Proof of the Main Results ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>) that</span></p>
<table id="S4.EGx36" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S4.Ex38"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
