.900em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\ f(\overline{X}^{k})-\eta\|\overline{\nabla}F({X}_{[N]}^{k})\|_{*}+(2\eta+\lambda\theta q)\|\nabla F({X}_{[N]}^{k})-M_{[N]}^{k}\|_{*}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
