<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex61.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\theta p\|\nabla F({X}_{[N]}^{k})-M_{[N]}^{k}\|_{F}^{\alpha}+\frac{(\alpha-1)((2\eta+\lambda\theta q)\sqrt{\min\{m,n\}})^{\alpha/(\alpha-1)}}{\alpha^{\alpha/(\alpha-1)}(\theta p)^{1/(\alpha-1)}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">η</mi></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">q</mi></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">m</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">n</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">p</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\theta p\|\nabla F({X}_{[N]}^{k})-M_{[N]}^{k}\|_{F}^{\alpha}+\frac{(\alpha-1)((2\eta+\lambda\theta q)\sqrt{\min\{m,n\}})^{\alpha/(\alpha-1)}}{\alpha^{\alpha/(\alpha-1)}(\theta p)^{1/(\alpha-1)}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S4.p17.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.p17.3.1" class="ltx_text">This along with (<a href="#S4.E26" title="In Proof. ‣ IV Proof of the Main Results ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">26</span></a>) and <math id="S4.p17.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q=2\eta/(1-\lambda)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>η</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q=2\eta/(1-\lambda)</annotation></semantics></math> implies that</span></p>
<table id="S4.EGx45" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S4.Ex62"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
