<tbody id="S4.Ex64"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex64.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\hskip 18.49988pt+2p(N\sigma\theta)^{\alpha}+\lambda\theta qL_{F}\Big(\frac{2\sqrt{N}\lambda}{1-\lambda}+1\Big)\eta+\frac{N\sigma\lambda q\theta^{2}}{1-\theta}+\Big(\frac{\sqrt{N}\lambda}{1-\lambda}+\frac{1}{2}\Big)L_{*}\eta^{2}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">σ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">L</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msqrt><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">η</mi></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">σ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">λ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">L</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">η</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hskip 18.49988pt+2p(N\sigma\theta)^{\alpha}+\lambda\theta qL_{F}\Big(\frac{2\sqrt{N}\lambda}{1-\lambda}+1\Big)\eta+\frac{N\sigma\lambda q\theta^{2}}{1-\theta}+\Big(\frac{\sqrt{N}\lambda}{1-\lambda}+\frac{1}{2}\Big)L_{*}\eta^{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S4.p17.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.p17.4.1" class="ltx_text">The conclusion (<a href="#S4.E25" title="In Lemma 7. ‣ IV Proof of the Main Results ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">25</span></a>) then follows from this and (<a href="#S4.E9" title="In IV Proof of the Main Results ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>).
∎</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="S4.p18" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.p18.1" class="ltx_p">We are now ready to prove Theorem <a href="#Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem 1 (iteration complexity). ‣ II A Decentralized Muon ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<div id="S4.8" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_bold ltx_title_proof">Proof of Theorem <a href="#Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem 1 (iteration complexity). ‣ II A Decentralized Muon ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>.</h6>
<div id="S4.p19" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.p19.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.p19.1.1" class="ltx_text">Let <math id="S4.p19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{(X^{k}_{i},M^{k}_{i},V^{k}_{i})\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>M</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{(X^{k}_{i},M^{k}_{i},V^{k}_{i})\}</annotation></semantics></math> be generated by Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ II A Decentralized Muon ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> with <math id="S4.p19.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\eta,\theta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\eta,\theta)</annotation></semantics></math> given in Theorem <a href="#Thmtheorem1" title="Theorem 1 (iteration complexity). ‣ II A Decentralized Muon ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> and <math id="S4.p19.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{\mathcal{P}_{k}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\mathcal{P}_{k}\}</annotation></semantics></math> be defined in (<a href="#S4.E9" title="In IV Proof of the Main Results ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>) with such <math id="S4.p19.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{(X^{k}_{i},M^{k}_{i},V^{k}_{i})\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>M</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{(X^{k}_{i},M^{k}_{i},V^{k}_{i})\}</annotation></semantics></math> and the following <math id="S4.p19.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(p,q)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(p,q)</annotation></semantics></math>:</span></p>
<table id="S4.EGx46" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S4.E27"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.E27.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle p=K^{(\alpha^{2}-3\alpha+2)/(3\alpha-2)},\hskip 9.24994ptq=2\eta/(1-\lambda)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">p</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">K</mi><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="1.097em">,</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">q</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">η</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">λ</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle p=K^{(\alpha^{2}-3\alpha+2)/(3\alpha-2)},\hskip 9.24994ptq=2\eta/(1-\lambda).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(27)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S4.p19.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.p19.2.1" class="ltx_text">Notice that <math id="S4.p19.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S4.p19.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta\in(0,1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta\in(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math>. Hence, <math id="S4.p19.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\eta,\theta,p,q)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\eta,\theta,p,q)</annotation></semantics></math> satisfies the assumptions in Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma7" title="Lemma 7. ‣ IV Proof of the Main Results ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> and Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ II A Decentralized Muon ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>. Recall from that</span></p>
<table id="S4.EGx47" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S4.Ex65"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex65.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[\|M^{0}_{[N]}-\nabla F(X^{0}_{[N]})\|_{F}^{\alpha}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">0</mn></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">0</mn></msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi></msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[\|M^{0}_{[N]}-\nabla F(X^{0}_{[N]})\|_{F}^{\alpha}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex65.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\mathbb{E}[\|G(X^{0}_{[N]};\xi^{0}_{[N]})-\nabla F(X^{0}_{[N]})\|_{*}^{\alpha}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo mathsize="0.900em">≤</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">G</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">0</mn></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">ξ</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">0</mn></msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">0</mn></msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi></msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\mathbb{E}[\|G(X^{0}_{[N]};\xi^{0}_{[N]})-\nabla F(X^{0}_{[N]})\|_{*}^{\alpha}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S4.Ex66"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex66.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\mathbb{E}\Big[\Big(\sum_{i=1}^{N}\|G(X^{0}_{i};\xi^{0}_{i})-\nabla f_{i}(X^{0}_{i})\|_{*}\Big)^{\alpha}\Big]\leq(N\sigma)^{\alpha}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo mathsize="0.900em">≤</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">[</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" movablelimits="false" stretchy="true">∑</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></munderover></mstyle><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">G</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">0</mn></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">ξ</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">0</mn></msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">f</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">0</mn></msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub></mrow><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">)</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi></msup><mo maxsize="1.600em" minsize="1.600em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">≤</mo><msup><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">σ</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\mathbb{E}\Big[\Big(\sum_{i=1}^{N}\|G(X^{0}_{i};\xi^{0}_{i})-\nabla f_{i}(X^{0}_{i})\|_{*}\Big)^{\alpha}\Big]\leq(N\sigma)^{\alpha}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S4.p19.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.p19.3.1" class="ltx_text">In addition, it follows from the fact that <math id="S4.p19.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V^{-1}_{i}=\mathbf{0}_{m\times n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mn>𝟎</mn><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V^{-1}_{i}=\mathbf{0}_{m\times n}</annotation></semantics></math> for all <math id="S4.p19.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in[N]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in[N]</annotation></semantics></math>, Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma3" title="Lemma 3. ‣ IV Proof of the Main Results ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>(i), and Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma5" title="Lemma 5. ‣ IV Proof of the Main Results ‣ DeMuon: A Decentralized Muon for Matrix Optimization over Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> with <math id="S4.p19.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=-1</annotation></semantics></math> that</span></p>
<table id="S4.EGx48" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="S4.Ex67"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex67.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[\|V_{[N]}^{0}-\mathbf{1}_{N}\otimes\overline{V}^{0}\|_{*}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">0</mn></msubsup><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><msub><mn mathsize="0.900em">𝟏</mn><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.222em">⊗</mo><msup><mover accent="true"><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mo stretchy="true">¯</mo></mover><mn mathsize="0.900em">0</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathbb{E}[\|V_{[N]}^{0}-\mathbf{1}_{N}\otimes\overline{V}^{0}\|_{*}]</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="S4.Ex67.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\frac{\lambda\theta}{1-\theta}\mathbb{E}[\|\nabla F(X^{0}_{[N]})-M^{0}_{[N]}\|_{*}]+\frac{\lambda\sigma\theta}{1-\theta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo mathsize="0.900em">≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">𝔼</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><msub><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">F</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">X</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">0</mn></msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">[</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">0</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true">‖</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">λ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">σ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\frac{\lambda\theta}{1-\theta}\mathbb{E}[\|\nabla F(X^{0}_{[N]})-M^{0}_{[N]}\|_{*}]+\frac{\lambda\sigma\theta}{1-\theta}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="S4.Ex68"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
